Subject: [PATCH] kcms/lookandfeel: add a global shortcut to toggle dark mode

Switching between the light and dark Global Themes could only be done in
System Settings or in the Brightness and Color widget. The auto-switcher
now registers a "Toggle Dark Mode" action that works like that toggle.

BUG: 511108
---
 kcms/lookandfeel/kded/CMakeLists.txt          |  2 ++
 .../kded/lookandfeelautoswitcher.cpp          | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../kded/lookandfeelautoswitcher.h            |  1 +
 3 files changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/kcms/lookandfeel/kded/CMakeLists.txt b/kcms/lookandfeel/kded/CMakeLists.txt
index e29d175b61..21275a6489 100644
--- a/kcms/lookandfeel/kded/CMakeLists.txt
